        "body": "### Weather Words\n\nsun ｜ rain ｜ cloud ｜ clouds ｜ wind ｜ sunny ｜ rainy ｜ windy ｜ hot ｜ cold\n\n### Nature Words\n\ntree ｜ flower ｜ leaf ｜ grass ｜ water ｜ beach ｜ sea\n\n### Animal Words\n\nanimal ｜ dog ｜ cat ｜ bird ｜ duck ｜ fish ｜ frog ｜ rabbit ｜ sheep ｜ horse ｜ cow\n\n### Animal Sounds and Movement Chunks\n\nwoof ｜ meow ｜ tweet ｜ quack ｜ Walk like a duck. ｜ Jump like a frog. ｜ Swim like a fish.\n\n### Observation and Care Input\n\nLook at the sky. ｜ Look at the sun. ｜ Look at the clouds. ｜ Touch the leaf. ｜ Show me a flower. ｜ Point to the tree. ｜ Be gentle. ｜ Animals need water. ｜ Animals need food.\n\n### Supported Child Output\n\nsunny ｜ rainy ｜ windy ｜ hot ｜ cold ｜ single nature words ｜ single animal words ｜ animal sounds\n\n### Optional Sentence Models for Ready Children\n\n[Optional Challenge] It's sunny. ｜ [Optional Challenge] It's rainy. ｜ [Optional Challenge] I see a bird. ｜ [Optional Challenge] Animals need water."
